 *
 * Supports these shapes:
 * 1) Multi-bars: { bars: { "SPY": [ {t,o,h,l,c,v,...}, ... ] }, next_page_token: "..." }
 * 2) Single-symbol bars (some clients): { bars: [ {t,o,h,l,c,v,...}, ... ], next_page_token: "..." }
 * 3) "bars" might be null when no data
